{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/toolpath-webmock/cassettes/README.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T17:24:16.914809Z","id":"aaebd21a0679245e4ec47fb786b3d95d813d98d455b9145f1ec78f1dac74db33","body":{"detail":"cassettes/pathbase pins the path share request and the 201 response byte for byte; what a deployed pathbase stores and serves back is not pinned. The stored row IS pinned in-process in empathic/pathbase (pathbase-goldens stored@<set>, including gemini/opencode/cursor as uploaded documents, pathbase pr/09). Closes with a recording mode against a deployed pathbase that captures GET .../download.","kind":"concern","summary":"the live pathbase stored row is unpinned (webmock layer 10)","tags":["declared-limit","unpinned","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/toolpath-webmock/cassettes/README.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T19:07:12.491129Z","id":"389dcdab0b82ff9090eadcddb42e0e6562a83bc744411d1408fb178c773cb8e0","body":{"detail":"Seen 2026-10-19 on copilot: with the committed (scrubbed) cassettes the only remaining /v1/messages difference is the cwd and session folder in the system prompt (<scratch>/... vs the replay machine's path). The pre-scrub copies replay exact. Needs the normalizer to mask HOME and the cell directory on both sides, then a re-record.","kind":"concern","summary":"committed model cassettes do not replay exactly: their bodies carry <scratch> for the recording machine's paths","tags":["webmock","replay","declared-limit","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
